## 席位核对 · ACCEPT · 2026-11-06T06:04Z · #30512 (package 9 of 11, plugin-approvals, second half)

Head-sha: c582c20554665466c6ac52ed920d500f09dbef36

- **Shape:** 19 files, +1464/−10. Everything is in `packages/plugins/plugin-approvals/`, plus one patch changeset. Under the 3000-line threshold and inside claim 6672078792. Not governed. One commit on `origin/main` `c17719dd`. It is the handover patch `2dffb78d` carried unchanged (patch id `01aee2a9`). What it adds:
  - three new locale bundles (ru, de, ko), each with its source-hash companion;
  - their registration in `translations/index.ts`;
  - the three locales' entries in `messages.ts` and `pages.ts`;
  - the record page's inline Details / Timeline labels;
  - `APPROVAL_EMAIL_LINK_LINES`;
  - the extract config's `--locales` list and stack locales;
  - six tests that add the three bundles to their locale lists.
- **Spot check (read in the diff):**
  - `APPROVAL_EMAIL_LINK_LINES` gains three lines, each keeping `{{approvalUrl}}` byte-identical. The template shape and selection are untouched, exactly as in the first half (#30790).
  - `ruMessages`, `deMessages` and `koMessages` each carry all 40 keys of `enMessages`, with the same placeholder set per key (seat-checked over the file at this head). No value starts with the article `os `, so `check-cli-command-ids` has nothing to read; the dev also ran that lane locally.
  - The widened locale keys stay unreachable from the package entry, as in the first half.
  - `sys-approval-request-page.test.ts` pins the served set at all eleven locales and still holds each one to its authored label. The other test edits only add the three bundles to their lists, and no assertion is relaxed.
- **Gates:** every check-run on this head has concluded: 48 distinct checks, the latest run of each 35 success, 13 skipped, 0 failure. Locally (dev report 6677862325): build 118/118, plugin-approvals 115 files / 1498 tests, typecheck OK, `check-i18n-bundles --filter=approvals` in sync (21 bundles), stale-fill OK, and the docs & code guards lane at 56 × exit 0. The 61 derived families and `pnpm lint` exit 0 at `89c1a860`, the same patch, with an identical re-derived list.
- **Contract:** `Clause-②: no`, `Metadata-protocol: none`, confirmed from the diff: translations and internal locale-key widening only.
- **Landing:** ready, then auto-merge, through the relay. With it, plugin-approvals serves all eleven platform languages. The card stays open for the plugin-sharing `sys_assignment_rule` follow-up and for settings A/B.
